      "content": "i get what you're saying but honestly i just dont have the time for a clinic visit right now. if i were to just take a higher dose of magnesium, like maybe 400mg or 500mg twice a day, do you think that would help settle the palpitations? i feel like if i just stay on the couch and really load up on supplements for a week i can probably just ride this out without needing a full checkup. seems like a safer way to handle it for now.",
